{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_05",
  "title": "人言可畏",
  "storyCode": "NL-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1a0909f1db6bed3a8529ee284da82144f7deb76c9e93e69249e4e187a7d89f5b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 5-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咕——咕啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐败骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——啊啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......报告，凋零骑士服药后产生了明显的排斥反应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不......在其他骑士身上并没有发现类似的反应，在场的药师推测是萨卡兹的过敏反应......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？可......可这很浪费......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "浓度比例......已经接近常规的凝胶修复液了，这玩意是用来修盔甲的啊，继续注射会对人脑造成不可逆的损伤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好吧，我明白，他们是萨卡兹，不是人类......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，你们也听见了，再增加百分之零点三......测试一下萨卡兹的极限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们，是什么东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘎啊......嘎啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐败骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你......梦魇......死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的梦魇长叹一口气。他仰头望去，熟悉的黑夜被灯光驱散。\n这也是文明兴起的象征吗？卡西米尔在用霓虹灯征服黑夜吗？\n他突然有些感伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "玛莉娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你没事......你没事真是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎、哎，佐菲娅姐姐？别、别哭啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你没事就好，玛莉娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是你出了什么事情，我们可没脸去见临光老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "虽然现在也没脸去见就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊哈哈......各位还很长寿呢，胡说什么呢，咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个......佐菲娅姐姐？差不多可以放手了吧......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "打扰这一幅姐妹情深的情景实在让人于心不忍......不过玛嘉烈似乎不在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......呃，你什么时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "从你带着哭腔抱上去开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呀......你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，他是刚才帮我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......！你、你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你认错人了，老骑士先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以，玛嘉烈呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "出了这么大事，我们神经大条的耀骑士难道还在勇闯特锦赛吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我......我不知道该不该告诉姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嚯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "无胄盟不会善罢甘休的吧......他们迟早会再攻击过来的，大家都会有危险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是......但是如果告诉了姐姐......才是正中他们的下怀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在这座大骑士领，你们无处可逃，他们迟早都会来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今时不同往日，哪怕是下一秒和现在比起来，商业联合会都在壮大自身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......为了你的安全，玛莉娅，你姐姐必须知道这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "姐姐知道了，就能解决吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "姐姐放弃了特锦赛，他们真的就会就此罢休吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（我，我在想什么......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......迷茫不是坏事，别像那个谁一样就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好了，既然玛嘉烈不在，我还有点私事，就先告辞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "慢着，你到底——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "佐菲娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "随他去吧，别问了，没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但，还是得谢谢你救了玛莉娅，如果有什么可以帮你的......和我们说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......对了，出剑方向偏了点，玛莉娅，平衡不对，速度也慢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过看样子似乎是心态问题，可惜少女心我可就不懂咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "心态......吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "骑士的战斗可不在赛场上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "借来的梦想，是走不远的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "赦罪师。认真的？这个名字听着就很厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "质疑的话，去和那位玄铁本人说说看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......那还是算了，他也是萨卡兹吧，传奇佣兵之类的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "卡兹戴尔的萨卡兹，耀骑士，还有这个罗德岛......真有意思啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有意思，也有些碍事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一面要应付董事会，一面要应付骑士协会，一面还要兢兢业业地处理感染者，这日子，何时是个头哟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是啊，快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但玄铁老爷们还是不愿意露面，那意思是，最后这点脏活全要我们干咯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "慢着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "手下留情如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......他们败在我的手里，我有权处置他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他们也是我的同族。我不忍看见同族在卡西米尔落得如此下场，把他们交给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......同族......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "肮脏的东西，甚至不配称为我天途的战利品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各废去他们一臂，以作教训。带他们走吧，别碍眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这么好说话？我还以为我们得打上一场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸欸欸，别提刀，当我没说，当我没说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "耀骑士战胜了烛骑士之后，在媒体和城际网络上掀起了轩然大波。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "加上最近大骑士领出现了各种非法感染者暴力事件，更加剧了民众恐慌——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "零号地块负责人，商业联合会发言人将于近日召开记者发布会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......总之，就是这样，博士，阿米娅小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些日子......零号地块可能会不太太平。之前城内引发的一些暴乱现在都被认为是感染者所为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......情况很特殊。但我们也不希望因此终止感染者收容治疗的机能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这几天，希望罗德岛的各位就不要到处走动了，很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......博士......这些新闻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很遗憾，不完全是捏造的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "感染者骑士确实开始骚动起来，特别是在耀骑士战胜了烛骑士之后呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "仅当晚发生的暴力事件就有十一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "人言可畏，而这些媒体比谁都精通此道。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "真相不会是这样的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蓉",
          "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
          "text": "......说是有些董事会的重要人物都遭到了袭击？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蓉",
          "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
          "text": "哇啊......竟然都出现游行了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蓉",
          "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
          "text": "但愿不要影响到那些骑士......昨天那位姐姐还说，赢了比赛要给弟弟妹妹买玩具来着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......那，临光小姐是不是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的人群",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "感染者离开卡西米尔！感染者不属于大骑士领！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的人群",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "感染者收治区等于矿石病培养皿！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "下班的员工",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......这附近发生什么了？我怎么开了个会出门，就变成了这样？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赶路的员工",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯？你看对面城区不就是感染者收容治疗中心吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赶路的员工",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "抗议罢了，下午的时候更过分，还拉超大的横幅呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......你们有什么事吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的骑士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......耀骑士......你知道为什么那些感染者敢公开行动吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的骑士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他们在城市里引发暴力事件......把那些无辜的市民卷入其中，他们哪来的胆子？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的骑士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是你给他们的胆子！是你和血骑士，你们这些感染者骑士！你让他们有了反抗的权力！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的骑士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......我......我知道你不是一个坏人，冠军。我以前甚至是你的粉丝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的骑士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但你继续参加特锦赛，只会给其他感染者一个错觉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的骑士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "一个......他们可以......改变当下的错觉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "抗议的骑士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "好自为之吧，耀骑士......不要让自己后悔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "............"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "怎么了，临光？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "你的表情，可不像是刚大获全胜的骑士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "临光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "有心事的话，要说出来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯......只是关于感染者的一些事情。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......这个话题，我有一些别的线索。阿米娅已经知道了这些事，毫无疑问，这些事情背后是被人操纵的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "但是现在的你，不需要分神处理这些事情。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "相信我，相信罗德岛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "你只要安心点亮你的光就好，临光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "但是......但是也不要太勉强。你很强大，但是你的疲惫在积攒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "偶尔也要放松一下喔？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......卡西米尔，是我的家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "见到长大的玛莉娅想要成为骑士，看见佐菲娅和老马丁他们都有着自己的生活......我很欣慰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是此刻，有你们在身边，我能感到更加安心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......我们也是临光小姐的家人吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "说不定呢，丽兹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "离入冬还有些时日，但卡西米尔的夜晚总是更加凉爽。丽兹，回阿米娅那里吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......你“离开”罗德岛之后，大家都很关心你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我知道，但正因如此，我更不能将他们卷入我的事情里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......我们就可以了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "如果你们不愿意的话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "真难得，耀骑士也懂得开玩笑了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......音乐？是......附近的酒吧吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "以前这里只是一排普通的写字楼，我记得，曾是一个出版社。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "大骑士领原本并没有这样的规模......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但这几十年间，每逢特锦赛，大骑士领就通过“竞标”的方式，选出其他三座城市进行合并。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "四城联合，卡瓦莱利亚基。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......城市在变化，我对我的家乡......有些，陌生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "你回到这里没有多久，临光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "而且你立刻扎进了骑士竞技里......扎进了你的理想里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "你还没有在这里重新开始生活，确确实实的生活......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "迟早会的，也许不是现在。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......你很累了，我能感觉到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "要散散步吗？也许夜风可以吹散你的疲劳。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......好啊，丽兹，让我牵着你的手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......烛骑士是个难缠的对手吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "卡西米尔还有她那样的骑士，让我很意外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "她很强，但她的迷茫成为了她的弱点......未能在她全盛的时刻和她分出胜负，很遗憾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "你乐在其中......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......过去我曾无比痛恨骑士竞技。不，哪怕此刻，我依旧为如今的卡西米尔深感悲哀。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但我们......见过了许多，不是吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "三人缓缓踱步在卡西米尔夜晚的街道上。\n远离了闹市与喧嚣，这条小巷只剩下些许城市的余温。\n这些余温化作了酒与歌声，以及匆匆行人所留下的面包香气。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要做的事情是不会变的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......哪怕，我的命运最后只是一场荒诞的冒险。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "——如夜风中飞行的羽。\n——如满怀梦想的旅人。\n——骑士踏上征途。\n——去找寻挚爱。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......动听的歌声。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "也许是一位沧桑的流浪歌手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "卡西米尔也会有这样浪漫的地方吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "这是，有人生活着的证明。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "——如矢车菊般脆弱的命运。\n——将经历风暴的考验。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......哼哼......哼哼哼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......丽兹，你想跳舞吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "哎？我？我这样......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "临光",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "没事的，握住我的手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "哇......慢、慢点，临光......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "青鸟飞向了温婉的深空。\n霓虹灯从高楼的间隙中逃逸，在悠扬的时间中穿梭。\n骑士牵着萨卡兹的手，在影影绰绰的灯光下穿行。\n宛如拉特兰最崇高的圣像。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......很美，丽兹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "真、真的吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "也许有一天，你能够真正起舞的，丽兹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......那一天来临的时候，你还会在我们身边吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "当然。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "骑士停下了舞步，在提灯女神的身前俯下身姿。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我发誓，丽兹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......我们会等你的，临光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "在你道路的尽头，在你燃尽自己光芒的那一刻来临之前，我们一定会在你的身边。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "如果那时——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "临光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗伊",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "晚上好，耀骑士......唔，还有那位美丽的萨卡兹小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗伊",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这么快就能再见面，我都有点感动了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
